#. ja: スタンダードステップ
#. de: Einfache Choreographie
#. fr: Pas classique
#. column 1: Caught up in the dance and only able to execute step actions, additional actions, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Head Graze</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bolt</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Medical Kit</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Standard Finish</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>En Avant</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
