#. fr: Péan martial
#. column 1: Direct hit rate is increased.
msgctxt "Status:2218:0:0"
msgid "Army's Paeon"
msgstr "Военный пеан"

#. ja: ダイレクトヒット発動率が向上した状態。
#. de: Direkte Trefferrate ist erhöht.
#. fr: Les chances de coups nets sont augmentées.
#. column 0: Army's Paeon
msgctxt "Status:2218:0:1"
msgid "Direct hit rate is increased."
msgstr "Повышен шанс прямого попадания."

#. ja: 黒の竜血
#. de: Schwarzes Drachenblut
#. fr: Sang noir du dragon
#. column 1: Drawing on power inherited from Nidhogg.
msgctxt "Status:2219:0:0"
msgid "Shadow of the Dragon"
msgstr "Тень дракона"

