msgctxt "Status:2534:0:1"
msgid "Bearing signs that the end may be nigh. Too many stacks will result in <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Doom</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "На вас метка неминуемой гибели. Если накопится слишком много зарядов, вы получите эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>«Рок»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 汚染
#. de: Kontaminierung
#. fr: Corruption
#. column 1: Black wavelengths pulse in front of you, and white wavelengths behind, causing massive damage if hit by attacks of the opposite color.
msgctxt "Status:2535:0:0"
msgid "Distorted"
msgstr "Искажение"

#. ja: 自身の正面が黒の力に、背面が白の力に侵食された状態。<br>異なる色の力で攻撃を受けた場合、大ダメージを受けてしまう。
#. de: Die Vorderseite ist von schwarzen Partikeln kontaminiert, die Rückseite von weißen Partikeln.<br>Erleidet schweren Schaden beim Aufeinandertreffen entgegengesetzter Partikel.
#. fr: Le corps est corrompu devant par la couleur noire, derrière par la couleur blanche. D'importants dégâts sont subis en cas d'attaque de couleur opposée à celle du côté touché.
#. column 0: Distorted
msgctxt "Status:2535:0:1"
msgid "Black wavelengths pulse in front of you, and white wavelengths behind, causing massive damage if hit by attacks of the opposite color."
msgstr "Спереди вас окружает чёрная сила, сзади — белая.<br>Атака силой другого цвета нанесёт огромный урон."

#. ja: 槍強化
#. de: Upgrade: Lanze
#. fr: Lance renforcée
#. column 1: Weapon is enhanced.<br><br>Will grant the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stronger Together</ui-edge-color></ui-color> if Hansel and Gretel move close together.
msgctxt "Status:2537:0:0"
msgid "Strong of Spear"
msgstr "Усиленное копьё"

#. ja: 槍が強化された状態。<br>ヘンゼルとグレーテルが接近した場合、槍盾強化状態になる。
#. de: Die Lanze ist verstärkt.<br>Sind Hänsel und Gretel nicht voneinander getrennt, wirkt das Upgrade sowohl auf Lanze als auch Schild.
#. fr: La lance est renforcée.<br>Si Hansel et Gretel se rapprochent l'un de l'autre, leurs boucliers le sont également.
#. column 0: Strong of Spear
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:2537:0:1"
msgid "Weapon is enhanced.<br><br>Will grant the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stronger Together</ui-edge-color></ui-color> if Hansel and Gretel move close together."
msgstr "Копьё усилено.<br><br>Если Гензель и Гретель сблизятся, вы получите эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>«Вместе сильнее»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 盾強化
#. de: Upgrade: Schild
#. fr: Bouclier renforcé
#. column 1: Shield is enhanced, decreasing damage taken. Attacks from the sides and rear are turned back on the attacker.<br><br>Will grant the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stronger Together</ui-edge-color></ui-color> if Hansel and Gretel move close together.
msgctxt "Status:2538:0:0"
msgid "Strong of Shield"
msgstr "Усиленный щит"

#. ja: 盾が強化され、被ダメージが低下した状態。また側面と後方からの攻撃を反射する。<br>ヘンゼルとグレーテルが接近した場合、槍盾強化状態になる。
#. de: Der Schild ist verstärkt und erlittener Schaden ist verringert. Angriffe von hinten und der Seite werden reflektiert.<br>Sind Hänsel und Gretel nicht voneinander getrennt, wirkt das Upgrade sowohl auf Lanze als auch Schild.
#. fr: Le bouclier est renforcé. Les dégâts subis sont réduits, et les attaques par les côtés et par derrière sont parées.<br>Si Hansel et Gretel se rapprochent l'un de l'autre, leurs lances sont également renforcées.
#. column 0: Strong of Shield
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:2538:0:1"
msgid "Shield is enhanced, decreasing damage taken. Attacks from the sides and rear are turned back on the attacker.<br><br>Will grant the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stronger Together</ui-edge-color></ui-color> if Hansel and Gretel move close together."
msgstr "Щит усилен, получаемый урон снижен. Атаки сбоку и сзади отражаются на атакующего.<br><br>Если Гензель и Гретель сблизятся, вы получите эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>«Вместе сильнее»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 槍盾強化
#. de: Upgrade: Lanze & Schild
#. fr: Lance et bouclier renforcés
#. column 1: Hansel and Gretel's proximity enhances their weapons and shields, decreasing damage taken. Attacks from the sides and rear are turned back on the attacker.
msgctxt "Status:2539:0:0"
msgid "Stronger Together"
msgstr "Вместе сильнее"

#. ja: ヘンゼルとグレーテルが接近して槍と盾が強化され、被ダメージが低下した状態。<br>また側面と後方からの攻撃を反射する。
#. de: Hänsel und Gretel gewähren einander Upgrades. Sowohl Lanze als auch Schild sind verstärkt, erlittener Schaden ist verringert und Angriffe von hinten und der Seite werden reflektiert.
#. fr: La lance et le bouclier sont renforcés. Les dégâts subis sont réduits.<br>Les attaques par les côtés et par derrière sont parées.
#. column 0: Stronger Together
msgctxt "Status:2539:0:1"
msgid "Hansel and Gretel's proximity enhances their weapons and shields, decreasing damage taken. Attacks from the sides and rear are turned back on the attacker."
msgstr "Гензель и Гретель сблизились, усилив оружие и щиты. Получаемый урон снижен. Атаки сбоку и сзади отражаются на атакующего."

#. ja: 冷却
#. de: Kühlung
#. fr: Réfrigération
#. column 1: Growing colder by the moment. Failure to continue moving until this effect expires will result in <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Deep Freeze</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
msgctxt "Status:2540:0:0"
msgid "Freezing Up"
msgstr "Замерзание"

#. ja: 冷却している状態。効果終了まで移動し続けなければ、氷結状態になる。
#. de: Wird zu Tiefkühlung, wenn der Charakter sich nicht bis Ende der Wirkung dauernd bewegt.
#. fr: Le corps est refroidi. Si la victime ne se déplace pas constamment avant la fin de l'effet, elle subit Congélation.
#. column 0: Freezing Up
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:2540:0:1"
msgid "Growing colder by the moment. Failure to continue moving until this effect expires will result in <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Deep Freeze</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Вам становится всё холоднее. Если до конца эффекта не продолжать двигаться, вы получите эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>«Глубокая заморозка»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 軟体化
#. de: Verweichlicht
#. fr: Tout mou
#. column 1: Rendered a boneless ooze unable to jump or execute actions. Movement speed is reduced.
msgctxt "Status:2543:0:0"
msgid "Gelatinous"
msgstr "Желеобразный"

#. ja: 軟体化した状態。移動速度が低下し、かつジャンプおよびアクションが実行不可となる。
#. de: Die Be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>ge<shy>schwin<shy>dig<shy>keit ist verringert. Das Ausführen von Sprüngen und Kommandos ist nicht möglich.
#. fr: Le corps est tout mou. La vitesse de déplacement est réduite et aucun saut ni aucune action ne peuvent être effectués.
#. column 0: Gelatinous
msgctxt "Status:2543:0:1"
msgid "Rendered a boneless ooze unable to jump or execute actions. Movement speed is reduced."
msgstr "Превратился в бесформенную слизь: не может прыгать и использовать умения, скорость передвижения снижена."

#. ja: 決闘指名
#. de: Schlachtbefehl
#. fr: Gant relevé
#. column 1: Singled out for combat. Damage from opponent's first blow will be reduced; however, failing to receive a blow from said opponent before this effect expires will result in KO.
msgctxt "Status:2545:0:0"
msgid "Duel or Die"
msgstr "Дуэль насмерть"

#. ja: 決闘に指名された状態。指名相手からの攻撃を受けた場合、1回だけ被ダメージを軽減する。ただし、指名相手から攻撃を受けずに効果時間が終了した場合、戦闘不能状態に陥る。
#. de: 1 Angriff des Ziels wird geschwächt. Führt das Ziel keinen Angriff aus, geht der Wirkende K. o.
#. fr: A relevé le défi lancé par l'adversaire. La prochaine attaque en provenance de ce dernier infligera moins de dégâts. Rend K.O. si aucune attaque n'est subie avant la fin de l'effet.
#. column 0: Duel or Die
msgctxt "Status:2545:0:1"
msgid "Singled out for combat. Damage from opponent's first blow will be reduced; however, failing to receive a blow from said opponent before this effect expires will result in KO."
msgstr "Вызван на бой. Первый удар противника нанесёт меньше урона. Если до окончания эффекта противник так и не ударит, персонаж погибнет."

#. ja: 炎の斧
#. de: Flammenaxt
#. fr: Hache de feu
#. column 1: Armed with a flaming axe. Additional effects are applied to auto-attacks.
msgctxt "Status:2547:0:0"
msgid "On Fire"
msgstr "В огне"

#. ja: ライアンの斧が燃え盛った状態。オートアタックに追加効果が発生する。
#. de: Auto-Attacken lösen einen Zusatzeffekt aus.
#. fr: Lyon a enflammé sa hache, conférant à ses attaques automatiques un effet sup<shy>plé<shy>men<shy>tai<shy>re.
#. column 0: On Fire
msgctxt "Status:2547:0:1"
msgid "Armed with a flaming axe. Additional effects are applied to auto-attacks."
